Survivor: "Good! Let me point out a few things on the screen."
Survivor: "Top-left is your [b]Scrap[/b] counter — that's your currency for building. Defeat zombies to earn more!"
Survivor: "Your [b]XP and Level[/b] are shown there too. Level up to unlock stronger gear."
Survivor: "And the [b]wave counter[/b] up top tells you how many waves are left. Stay sharp!"
